#: ../troubleshoot.rst:23
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "Pemecahan Masalah"

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../troubleshoot.rst:25
msgid ""
"If you are experiencing an issue with OpenShot, such as a freeze, crash, or "
"error message, there are many different techniques which can be useful for "
"troubleshooting the issue."
msgstr ""
"Jika Anda mengalami masalah dengan OpenShot, seperti pembekuan, crash, atau "
"pesan kesalahan, ada banyak teknik yang dapat berguna untuk memecahkan "
"masalah tersebut."

#: ../troubleshoot.rst:31
msgid "Using Logs to Troubleshoot a Problem"
msgstr "Menggunakan Log untuk Memecahkan Masalah"

#: ../troubleshoot.rst:33
msgid ""
"A log is a text file that records what OpenShot is doing, along with "
"warnings and errors. These files can help the support team understand a "
"problem, even when you do not see an error message on screen."
msgstr ""
"Log adalah file teks yang merekam apa yang dilakukan OpenShot, beserta "
"peringatan dan kesalahan. File-file ini dapat membantu tim dukungan memahami"
" masalah, bahkan ketika Anda tidak melihat pesan kesalahan di layar."

#: ../troubleshoot.rst:37
msgid ""
"OpenShot keeps two log files in the ``.openshot_qt`` folder inside your home"
" folder. On Linux and macOS, this location is written as "
"``~/.openshot_qt/``. The folder may be hidden in your file manager."
msgstr ""
"OpenShot menyimpan dua file log di folder ``.openshot_qt`` di dalam folder "
"home Anda. Pada Linux dan macOS, lokasi ini ditulis sebagai "
"``~/.openshot_qt/``. Folder ini mungkin tersembunyi di pengelola file Anda."

#: ../troubleshoot.rst:41
msgid "The two log files"
msgstr "Dua file log tersebut"

#: ../troubleshoot.rst:45
msgid "File"
msgstr "File"

#: ../troubleshoot.rst:46
msgid "What it records"
msgstr "Apa yang direkam"

#: ../troubleshoot.rst:47 ../troubleshoot.rst:74
msgid "``openshot-qt.log``"
msgstr "``openshot-qt.log``"

#: ../troubleshoot.rst:48
msgid ""
"Activity in the editor: starting OpenShot, loading projects, changing "
"settings, and using the interface. This is usually the best place to start "
"when investigating a problem."
msgstr ""
"Aktivitas di editor: memulai OpenShot, memuat proyek, mengubah pengaturan, "
"dan menggunakan antarmuka. Ini biasanya tempat terbaik untuk memulai saat "
"menyelidiki masalah."

#: ../troubleshoot.rst:51 ../troubleshoot.rst:77
msgid "``libopenshot.log``"
msgstr "``libopenshot.log``"

#: ../troubleshoot.rst:52
msgid ""
"Activity in OpenShot's video and audio engine, the part that reads media and"
" builds the pictures and sound used in previews and exported videos. "
"Detailed engine logging can help investigate playback and export problems."
msgstr ""
"Aktivitas di mesin video dan audio OpenShot, bagian yang membaca media dan "
"membangun gambar serta suara yang digunakan dalam pratinjau dan video yang "
"diekspor. Logging mesin yang rinci dapat membantu menyelidiki masalah "
"pemutaran dan ekspor."

#: ../troubleshoot.rst:56
msgid ""
"These files record different parts of the same application. When reporting a"
" problem, include both files if available. You do not need to understand "
"every line yourself."
msgstr ""
"File-file ini merekam bagian yang berbeda dari aplikasi yang sama. Saat "
"melaporkan masalah, sertakan kedua file jika tersedia. Anda tidak perlu "
"memahami setiap baris sendiri."

#: ../troubleshoot.rst:61
msgid "Choose which part of OpenShot to log"
msgstr "Pilih bagian OpenShot mana yang akan dicatat"

#: ../troubleshoot.rst:63
msgid "Open **Edit → Preferences → Advanced** to find these two settings:"
msgstr ""
"Buka **Edit → Preferences → Advanced** untuk menemukan dua pengaturan ini:"

#: ../troubleshoot.rst:65
msgid "Preferences and matching terminal options"
msgstr "Preferensi dan opsi terminal yang sesuai"

#: ../troubleshoot.rst:69
msgid "Preference"
msgstr "Preferensi"

#: ../troubleshoot.rst:70
msgid "Matching argument"
msgstr "Argumen yang sesuai"

#: ../troubleshoot.rst:71
msgid "Log file"
msgstr "File log"

#: ../troubleshoot.rst:72
msgid "User Interface Debug Logging"
msgstr "Logging Debug Antarmuka Pengguna"

#: ../troubleshoot.rst:73
msgid "``--debug-ui``"
msgstr "``--debug-ui``"

#: ../troubleshoot.rst:75
msgid "Video & Audio Engine Debug Logging"
msgstr "Logging Debug Mesin Video & Audio"

#: ../troubleshoot.rst:76 ../troubleshoot.rst:142
msgid "``--debug-engine``"
msgstr "``--debug-engine``"

#: ../troubleshoot.rst:79
msgid ""
"Both preferences are off by default, which keeps the normal summary "
"messages. Turning one on adds detail to its log file immediately. It does "
"not change the other log or add messages to the terminal. Preferences stay "
"enabled between launches until you turn them off."
msgstr ""
"Kedua preferensi ini mati secara default, yang menjaga pesan ringkasan "
"normal. Mengaktifkan salah satunya langsung menambahkan detail ke file "
"lognya. Ini tidak mengubah log lain atau menambahkan pesan ke terminal. "
"Preferensi tetap aktif antar peluncuran sampai Anda mematikannya."

#: ../troubleshoot.rst:84
msgid ""
"**User Interface Debug Logging** is a good starting point for problems with "
"startup, project loading, settings, or the interface. **Video & Audio Engine"
" Debug Logging** adds details about video and audio processing, which can "
"help investigate playback and export problems. Engine logs can grow very "
"quickly and may slow OpenShot down. Turn this setting on shortly before "
"repeating the problem, then turn it off afterward."
msgstr ""
"**Logging Debug Antarmuka Pengguna** adalah titik awal yang baik untuk "
"masalah dengan startup, pemuatan proyek, pengaturan, atau antarmuka. "
"**Logging Debug Mesin Video & Audio** menambahkan detail tentang pemrosesan "
"video dan audio, yang dapat membantu menyelidiki masalah pemutaran dan "
"ekspor. Log mesin dapat tumbuh sangat cepat dan mungkin memperlambat "
"OpenShot. Aktifkan pengaturan ini sesaat sebelum mengulangi masalah, lalu "
"matikan setelahnya."

#: ../troubleshoot.rst:91
msgid ""
"The engine preference was previously called **Debug Mode (Verbose)**. Its "
"saved on/off setting carries over to the new name."
msgstr ""
"Preferensi mesin sebelumnya disebut **Debug Mode (Verbose)**. Pengaturan "
"nyala/mati yang disimpan dibawa ke nama baru."

#: ../troubleshoot.rst:95
msgid "Use a terminal for one launch"
msgstr "Gunakan terminal untuk satu peluncuran"

#: ../troubleshoot.rst:97
msgid ""
"A terminal is a window where you type commands. The matching arguments "
"enable the same extra detail as the preferences, and also display it in the "
"terminal:"
msgstr ""
"Terminal adalah jendela tempat Anda mengetik perintah. Argumen yang sesuai "
"mengaktifkan detail tambahan yang sama seperti preferensi, dan juga "
"menampilkannya di terminal:"

#: ../troubleshoot.rst:104
msgid ""
"This records interface details for one launch. The familiar ``--debug`` and "
"shorter ``-d`` options mean exactly the same thing as ``--debug-ui``. For "
"video and audio engine details, use:"
msgstr ""
"Ini merekam detail antarmuka untuk satu peluncuran. Opsi ``--debug`` yang "
"dikenal dan versi pendek ``-d`` berarti persis sama dengan ``--debug-ui``. "
"Untuk detail mesin video dan audio, gunakan:"

#: ../troubleshoot.rst:112
msgid "To collect both types of detail together:"
msgstr "Untuk mengumpulkan kedua jenis detail bersama-sama:"

#: ../troubleshoot.rst:118
msgid ""
"Repeat the steps that cause the problem, then close OpenShot and collect the"
" logs. These arguments do not change your saved preferences. Starting "
"OpenShot normally returns to your usual logging settings."
msgstr ""
"Ulangi langkah-langkah yang menyebabkan masalah, lalu tutup OpenShot dan "
"kumpulkan lognya. Argumen ini tidak mengubah preferensi yang Anda simpan. "
"Memulai OpenShot secara normal akan kembali ke pengaturan logging biasa "
"Anda."

#: ../troubleshoot.rst:122
msgid ""
"``openshot-qt.log`` starts a new file when it reaches about 25 MB and keeps "
"three older copies. ``libopenshot.log`` keeps growing as messages are added."
" After saving any logs you need, you can remove old log files while OpenShot"
" is closed."
msgstr ""
"``openshot-qt.log`` memulai file baru ketika mencapai sekitar 25 MB dan "
"menyimpan tiga salinan lama. ``libopenshot.log`` terus bertambah saat pesan "
"ditambahkan. Setelah menyimpan log yang Anda butuhkan, Anda dapat menghapus "
"file log lama saat OpenShot ditutup."

#: ../troubleshoot.rst:128
msgid "Other command-line options"
msgstr "Opsi baris perintah lainnya"

#: ../troubleshoot.rst:130
msgid ""
"Most users only need the two controls above. The following options let you "
"choose how much detail goes into the files or appears in the terminal. Here,"
" *console* means the terminal output."
msgstr ""
"Sebagian besar pengguna hanya membutuhkan dua kontrol di atas. Opsi berikut "
"memungkinkan Anda memilih seberapa banyak detail yang masuk ke file atau "
"muncul di terminal. Di sini, *console* berarti keluaran terminal."

#: ../troubleshoot.rst:134
msgid "Logging options"
msgstr "Opsi logging"

#: ../troubleshoot.rst:138
msgid "Option"
msgstr "Opsi"

#: ../troubleshoot.rst:139
msgid "What it does"
msgstr "Fungsinya"

#: ../troubleshoot.rst:140
msgid "``--debug-ui``, ``--debug``, or ``-d``"
msgstr "``--debug-ui``, ``--debug``, atau ``-d``"

#: ../troubleshoot.rst:141
msgid "Enables User Interface Debug Logging in its file and the terminal."
msgstr ""
"Mengaktifkan Logging Debug Antarmuka Pengguna di file dan terminalnya."

#: ../troubleshoot.rst:143
msgid ""
"Enables Video & Audio Engine Debug Logging in its file and the terminal."
msgstr ""
"Mengaktifkan Logging Debug Mesin Video & Audio di file dan terminalnya."

#: ../troubleshoot.rst:144
msgid "``--debug-file``"
msgstr "``--debug-file``"

#: ../troubleshoot.rst:145
msgid ""
"Adds editor details to ``openshot-qt.log`` without adding terminal detail."
msgstr ""
"Menambahkan detail editor ke ``openshot-qt.log`` tanpa menambahkan detail di"
" terminal."

#: ../troubleshoot.rst:146
msgid "``--debug-console``"
msgstr "``--debug-console``"

#: ../troubleshoot.rst:147
msgid "Adds editor details in the terminal without adding file detail."
msgstr "Menambahkan detail editor di terminal tanpa menambahkan detail file."

#: ../troubleshoot.rst:148
msgid "``--log-level LEVEL``"
msgstr "``--log-level LEVEL``"

#: ../troubleshoot.rst:149
msgid "Sets the detail for both logs and their terminal output."
msgstr "Mengatur tingkat detail untuk kedua log dan keluaran terminalnya."

#: ../troubleshoot.rst:150
msgid "``--log-file-level LEVEL``"
msgstr "``--log-file-level LEVEL``"

#: ../troubleshoot.rst:151
msgid "Sets the detail for both log files, leaving terminal settings alone."
msgstr ""
"Mengatur tingkat detail untuk kedua file log, tanpa mengubah pengaturan "
"terminal."

#: ../troubleshoot.rst:152
msgid "``--log-console-level LEVEL``"
msgstr "``--log-console-level LEVEL``"

#: ../troubleshoot.rst:153
msgid ""
"Sets the detail in the terminal for both the editor and engine, leaving file"
" settings alone."
msgstr ""
"Mengatur detail di terminal untuk editor dan engine, tanpa mengubah "
"pengaturan file."

#: ../troubleshoot.rst:156
msgid ""
"Replace ``LEVEL`` with ``debug`` for detailed messages or ``info`` for the "
"normal summary. ``warning`` shows warnings and errors; ``error`` shows "
"errors and critical failures; ``critical`` shows only critical failures. "
"``off`` stops ordinary log messages, but existing crash diagnostics may "
"still be written. Uppercase names such as ``DEBUG`` work too."
msgstr ""
"Ganti ``LEVEL`` dengan ``debug`` untuk pesan rinci atau ``info`` untuk "
"ringkasan normal. ``warning`` menampilkan peringatan dan kesalahan; "
"``error`` menampilkan kesalahan dan kegagalan kritis; ``critical`` hanya "
"menampilkan kegagalan kritis. ``off`` menghentikan pesan log biasa, tetapi "
"diagnostik crash yang ada mungkin masih ditulis. Nama huruf besar seperti "
"``DEBUG`` juga berlaku."

#: ../troubleshoot.rst:162
msgid ""
"For example, to collect detailed messages in **both files** while keeping "
"the terminal at its usual level:"
msgstr ""
"Misalnya, untuk mengumpulkan pesan rinci di **kedua file** sambil menjaga "
"terminal pada tingkat biasanya:"

#: ../troubleshoot.rst:169
msgid ""
"This also enables the large engine log, so use it briefly. The older "
"``--debug-file`` and ``--debug-console`` options still work even though they"
" are not listed in ``--help``."
msgstr ""
"Ini juga mengaktifkan log engine besar, jadi gunakan sebentar saja. Opsi "
"lama ``--debug-file`` dan ``--debug-console`` masih berfungsi meskipun tidak"
" tercantum di ``--help``."

#: ../troubleshoot.rst:174
msgid "Environment variables"
msgstr "Variabel lingkungan"

#: ../troubleshoot.rst:176
msgid ""
"An environment variable is a named setting passed to a program when it "
"starts. These are useful when starting OpenShot from a script or when a "
"support person asks you to try a particular setting. You do not need to set "
"them for normal use."
msgstr ""
"Variabel lingkungan adalah pengaturan bernama yang diteruskan ke program "
"saat dimulai. Ini berguna saat memulai OpenShot dari skrip atau ketika "
"petugas dukungan meminta Anda mencoba pengaturan tertentu. Anda tidak perlu "
"mengaturnya untuk penggunaan normal."

#: ../troubleshoot.rst:180
msgid "Optional environment settings"
msgstr "Pengaturan lingkungan opsional"

#: ../troubleshoot.rst:184
